   "title": "Start here",
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Krea 2 - Train a LoRA\n\nTrains a Krea 2 **image** LoRA on a folder of images + captions, then tests it.\n\n1. Make the set with **krea2_4_lora_training_set** (or upload your own images + same-name .txt captions into a folder under `ComfyUI/output/`).\n2. **Load Training Set** (stage 1): the folder, default `krea2_dataset/my_person`. Deleted images are left out.\n3. **Test prompts** (stage 4): use your trigger word.\n4. **Run** once. Training takes a while (watch the progress bar on Train LoRA); then the test images render.\n\nThe LoRA is saved to `ComfyUI/output/loras/krea2_my_person_<steps>_steps_00001_.safetensors` and appears in every LoRA loader.\n\nNeeds a 32 GB+ GPU (RTX 5090) or 48 GB (L40S, A6000); 24 GB with **offloading** on, slowly. The Raw model downloads by default (`KREA2_MODELS=fp8,raw`).\n\n**Red nodes are the ones you set.** Stages run left to right with a note under each.\n\nFull instructions: https://github.com/tenitsky/krea2-image"
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
